<title>USA: Progressive Corp Q1 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Progressive Corp Q1 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MAYFIELD VILLAGE, Ohio 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.05		    $0.78</p>
<p> Oper net		   78,600		   60,200</p>
<p> Revs			966,500		  799,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   74,800		   74,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 net shr $1.02 vs $0.82.</p>
<p>Revenues include effects of securities sales. 1997 revenues lowered by $3.3 million from securities sales, while 1996 period revenues increased by $4.9 million from securities sales.</p>
<p>Avg shrs includes net effect of dilutive stock options.</p>
<p>Q1 net premiums written: $1.05 billion vs $810.2 million.</p>
</text>
